      },
      "note": [
        "Construction cost index including wage for multi-dwelling buildings and collectively built one- or two-dwelling buildings 2004 = 100 won´t be published anymore. We refer you rather use 1968 = 100 or 2015 = 100 instead. If you still want to follow index 2004 = 100 you can use the following conversion rates. Multiply the index 2015 = 100 and the conversion rates to convert the index to 2004 = 100.\r\n\r\nConstruction cost index including wage for multi-dwelling buildings:\r\ntotal (including VAT)                1,391\r\ntotal (excluding VAT)               1,391\r\nlabour                                      1,347                                               \r\n\r\nConstruction cost index including wage for collectively built one- or two-dwelling buildings except owner-occupied buildings:\r\ntotal (including VAT)                1,360\r\ntotal (excluding VAT)               1,357\r\nlabour                                      1,350                                               \r\n"
      ],
